  "details": "When the player's position is far away from the world origin (0,0,0), the cursor becomes difficult to control.\n\nThe cursor does not move smoothly and jumps several pixels at a time, even when moving the mouse slowly.\n\nThis problem does not occur when the player is near the world origin.\n\nAdditionally, this issue occurs only on the 3p-beta branch.\n\nIt does not occur on open-beta or live.\n\nA video demonstrating the issue is attached.",
